invalid type: string "ture birth of child  1 month  22 working days  \nExtended Maternity Leave  90 days  65 working days  \n \n Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ’s)  \n1. Are leaves credited on calendar year basis or financial year basis ? \n     A:  Leaves are credited to an employee’s  account as per calendar year i.e. from 1st January to 31st  \nDecember.  \n  \n ValueMomentum Document  \n \